2026-07-27T08:16:47.6768363Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6768987Z i /tmp/RtmpePnRxS/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6769224Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6769500Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6769913Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6770299Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6770833Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6771267Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:16:47.6958315Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:16:47.7038092Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:16:47.7376669Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:16:47.7503054Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
